  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is an odd function.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is an odd function.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p>",
